  (text "Inverting stage topology: VIN -> L301 -> SW -> C410 -> NEG_X -> L302 -> negative OUT; D301 ANODE=NEG_X, CATHODE=GND." (at 25.4 365.76 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "5ed9a7a9-a374-50ad-8721-e10141e5e543"))
  (text "Independent 10uH inductors, not shorted/parallel windings. C410 sees VIN + |VOUT|. Target -6.24V; negative continuous budget 0.12A." (at 25.4 373.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4f400b9c-9dbc-5926-a022-66002a35f45a"))
  (text "LT3094 MSE EP13 and EN3 go to negative IN, NOT GND. SET sinks 100uA. PG trip ~-5.04V. Kelvin OUTS/SET and >=10uF effective Cout required." (at 25.4 381 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4d2261e0-3347-5ece-ab2a-6b4f04630a37"))
  (text "ADR4525 pin8 DNC; configure DAC external-reference mode before use. Negative-loop ripple/thermal/startup and reference fanout remain bench gates." (at 25.4 388.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0d0348e3-43ee-5838-9f39-fd1b653f7f9c"))
